OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity puts glass centre
OL,4,Aequipment up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 200 pieces of equipment from the
OL,7,Fclosed-down National Glass Centre (NGC)
OL,8,Fare set to be auctioned off.
OL,10,FItems from the Sunderland venue, which
OL,11,Fshut in July, include glass kilns and
OL,12,Ffurnaces and are going under the hammer
OL,13,Fbetween now and 12 November.
OL,15,FThe equipment is owned by site
OL,16,Fcustodian Sunderland University, which
OL,17,Fsaid the open online auction would
OL,18,Fprovide a "fair and transparent
OL,19,Fopportunity" for interested buyers.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
