OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity puts glass centre
OL,4,Aequipment up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Specialist equipment will be donated
OL,7,Fto another charitable organisation,
OL,8,FSunderland Culture, for use in the
OL,9,Fplanned Glassworks Sunderland project
OL,10,Fand to establish glassmaking facilities
OL,11,Ffor artists in the period before the
OL,12,Fnew facility opens," a spokesperson
OL,13,Fsaid.
